  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YALI - Nyamai - XP Water Tank</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Over 70% of people living in Kenyas arid areas rely on rain for safe drinking water. Unfortunately, conventional plastic or concrete tanks of sufficient capacity for families or small communities are beyond the price point of most of the lower income portions of society. Peter is increasing access to rainwater by producing more cost efficient water tanks to communities that are rain dependent.</narrative>
  </description>
